From: OpenWrt CI maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: describe AX5 JDCloud's fixed 4-bit eMMC bus

The JDCloud board uses soldered eMMC. Explicitly describe the 4-bit bus
observed on the device instead of relying on the SDHCI driver's defaults.
Keep the existing HS200 mode and inherited maximum clock unchanged.
Do not modify the shared Xiaomi DTSI or enable HS400.

--- a/target/linux/qualcommax/files/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/ipq6000-ax5-jdcloud.dts
+++ b/target/linux/qualcommax/files/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/ipq6000-ax5-jdcloud.dts
@@ -15,6 +15,8 @@
 
 &sdhc {
 	status = "okay";
+	bus-width = <4>;
+	non-removable;
 
 	/delete-property/ mmc-hs400-1_8v;
 	mmc-hs200-1_8v;
